{"parse": {"title": "BBT-05", "pageid": 88294, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-04\" title=\"BBT-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">BBT-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-06\" title=\"BBT-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">BBT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B5.B7.E7.9B.97.E5.AE.A3.E8.A8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"海盗宣言\">海盗宣言</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 海盗宣言</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Pirate's Declaration</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>本<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>宣<span class=\"color-value\"></span>布<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>现<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>本<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>算<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192005</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“不速之客”们穿过旅店地下的层层通道，来到舞厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>嗨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我给大家带了个新朋友回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>是两位新朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗跟在她身后登场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这就是你们的老巢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>这只是个舞台，和旧金山的海滩没区别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指向身后的演出场地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>唯一可惜的是，这儿没有空调，也没有阳光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>但不管怎么说，搞乐队是很开心的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>在车上的时候我听你也说到了你喜欢的歌手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>在这方面，船长的品味一向……令人叹服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>一颗会说话的苹果？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乐队成员对APPLe先生的兴趣似乎要大过对摇滚海盗的兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>他是我最好的船员！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我也有自己的船员——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莱莉转身，向摇滚海盗介绍自己的“船员”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>贝斯手“四指”强尼，吉他手“闪光”莱安娜，鼓手“战锤”尤尼，键盘“章鱼”德米特里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>然后是我——主唱莱莉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一一介绍自己的乐队成员，将他们引介给新朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>我们打算录一套新唱片，然后偷偷分发给人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>喏——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她翻出制作碟片的“碟片”材料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>喔——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一大摞废旧的X光片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>X光片！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>用这东西录唱片吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>真是复古的手法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>没错！这都是俄国朋友带过来的办法，是我们亲爱的德米特里伙计教给大家的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处，正在调试键盘的小伙儿德米特里朝这边点头致敬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>在莫斯科风声最紧的日子，“骨碟”给了大伙儿接触摇滚乐的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>人们总是向往音乐的，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗同意这个想法，所以——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们为什么不去占领广播剧院呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗提出一个更“好”的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的沉默弥漫在炫彩灯光之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿！大伙儿怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她推推墨镜，继续自己的提议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>刻唱片，再分发……噢，这太麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们不如闹点大动静！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>直接去他们的老巢里来一场演出！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这才是真正的海盗做派！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，要占领广播剧院或许不是一件容易的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>这个想法会不会有点儿太激进了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对摇滚海盗的提议，她陷入了迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>海盗电台在淘金镇的特别节目！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>把音量开大，让音乐往他们脆弱的耳朵里灌！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>你想说，让我们把贝斯当武器，闯进那些老实家伙聚会的地方？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>再把他们的麦克风抢过来，唱上一首他们不让咱们唱的歌？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>没错，就是这样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝斯手咧嘴笑起来，露出闪亮的牙齿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>这可太酷了，算我一个！怎么说，莱莉，你愿意跟我们一起去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>先是贝斯手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后是鼓手和键盘手，用各自的乐器简单做了答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>是时候换个地方演出了，莱莉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>舞台上，莱莉的伙伴们似乎对摇滚海盗的提议颇感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>好吧伙计们，看来新朋友给了个不错的提议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>在这儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>怎么回事！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>事情看起来可不太妙了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>坏家伙们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗要狠狠敲打你们这些坏东西的脑袋！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被打败的警卫让绳子捆住，扔在舞台边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>只是用绳子捆住能行吗？他们万一逃走了，一定会来追我们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>放心，这绳子可是我老爸一直放在后备箱里的家传宝贝，捆得结实的呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>可他们是怎么找到这儿的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>是那封信吗，船长？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>APPLe先生，你在说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>APPLe先生自顾自地回忆着发生的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>信？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某在想，他们是怎么找到这儿来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们在路上遇到了一位自称启明会的先生，他送了船长一张邀请函。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>也许是某种神秘术定位？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>找我们做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>因为本海盗没有按照规定，去做什么“神秘学家入境登记”吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>海盗怎么可能去码头注册登记！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>让基金会掌握行踪已经是本海盗的底线了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱莉：</div><div>那我们最好烧掉那封信，星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们不仅要去占领剧院，还要带上这份信，带着这份邀请函，大大方方地进去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>神秘术定位？还有比高举定位冲进那群家伙的老巢更摇滚的事情吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>剧院里就应该有乐队！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗走向被绑起来的警卫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>禁令？等你们追上来的时候，摇滚的声音早就传遍整个小镇了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗨，伙计们，这一定是一场精彩绝伦的演出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>这是个很有意思的想法，亲爱的……“船长”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“水手”们的队伍逐渐壮大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>这是一种挑衅对不对，小海盗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>对！咱们不止要对那些老顽固比中指，还要把中指抵到他们鼻子尖上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>我喜欢这种“玩笑”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的贝斯手放好乐器，跳下舞台，走到摇滚海盗身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>现在我们来扮演你的船员，我喜欢演戏，这事儿大家都知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>船长说得对，大伙儿——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她转身面向伙伴们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“闪光”莱安娜：</div><div>放火狂欢应该在洗劫城镇之后！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“四指”强尼：</div><div>狂欢，莱安娜，说到这个，我还有个好主意！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水手们兴奋起来，音乐与密谋的声音在地下舞厅回荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>噢，他们似乎把我俩当成了真正的海盗，船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哈！难道我们不是吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗握住麦克风——尽管它还没通电，但不影响这位船长发出第一个命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>伙计们，行动起来，带上各自的家伙——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嗨嗨，起航！今天的目标是“启明会”码头！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "BBT-05"}}